{{#if scenarios}}
## Scenario Flow Diagram

```mermaid
graph TD
    Start([Start])
    
{{#each scenarios}}
{{#if is_main}}
    %% Main Scenario: {{title}}
    Start --> S{{@index}}_1[Step 1: {{steps.[0].description}}]
    {{#each steps}}
    {{#unless @first}}
    S{{../@index}}_{{../steps.[../@index].order}} --> S{{../@index}}_{{order}}[Step {{order}}: {{description}}]
    {{/unless}}
    {{/each}}
    {{#if steps}}
    S{{@index}}_{{steps.[steps.length-1].order}} --> End{{@index}}([End])
    {{/if}}
    
{{else}}
    %% Extension Scenario: {{title}}
    %% Extends {{extends_scenario_id}} at step {{extends_at_step}}
    {{#if extends_at_step}}
    S_{{extends_at_step}} -.->|Extension: {{title}}| E{{@index}}_1[{{steps.[0].description}}]
    {{#each steps}}
    {{#unless @first}}
    E{{../@index}}_{{@index}} --> E{{../@index}}_{{inc @index}}[{{description}}]
    {{/unless}}
    {{/each}}
    {{#if returns_at_step}}
    E{{@index}}_{{steps.length}} -.->|Return| S_{{returns_at_step}}
    {{else}}
    E{{@index}}_{{steps.length}} --> EndExt{{@index}}([End Extension])
    {{/if}}
    {{/if}}
    
{{/if}}
{{/each}}

    classDef mainScenario fill:#e1f5ff,stroke:#0066cc,stroke-width:2px
    classDef extension fill:#fff4e1,stroke:#ff9900,stroke-width:2px,stroke-dasharray: 5 5
    classDef repeat fill:#f0f0f0,stroke:#666,stroke-width:2px
    
{{#each scenarios}}
{{#if is_main}}
    {{#each steps}}
    class S{{../@index}}_{{order}} mainScenario
    {{/each}}
{{else}}
    {{#each steps}}
    class E{{../@index}}_{{@index}} extension
    {{/each}}
{{/if}}
{{/each}}
```

### Flow Legend
- **Solid lines** → Main scenario flow
- **Dashed lines** → Extension points and returns
- **Blue boxes** → Main scenario steps
- **Orange boxes** → Extension scenario steps

